# System Monitor configuration
#
# To enable Slack alerts, create an Incoming Webhook:
#
#   1. Go to https://api.slack.com/apps and click "Create New App"
#   2. Choose "From scratch", give it a name (e.g. "ServerBot"), select your workspace
#   3. In the left menu go to "Incoming Webhooks" and toggle it ON
#   4. Click "Add New Webhook to Workspace", pick a channel (e.g. #alerts-server)
#   5. Copy the Webhook URL (starts with https://hooks.slack.com/services/...)
#   6. Paste it below and save this file
#
SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=
